      errata/sifive: remove unreliable warn_miss_errata

Austin Kim (1):
      riscv: fix minor typo in syscall.h comment

Han Gao (1):
      riscv: compat: fix COMPAT_UTS_MACHINE definition

Paul Walmsley (1):
      riscv: signal: fix some warnings reported by sparse

